WEBVTT

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:23.060
Looks like it’s raining again
in this anonymous world

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:26.480
Where crowds prop up
revolutionaries' screeds

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:30.780
Polarity may as well not exist

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:34.070
Crumbling agony

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:38.080
We erased the dots we stared at

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:41.450
Without connecting them
Filling me with loss

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:47.040
Synthetic Sympathy

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.760
The desire to be revealed and embraced

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:02.060
Even solitude is dissolved
in the reticent sea

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:05.230
Unliberated freedom
leads to senseless crime

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:07.440
Bursting my eardrums

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:10.730
Sympathy
The sentiments to hurt and be kissed

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:15.070
Let the vortex of resonating memories
break free of time

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:19.990
Grasping the end of falsehood
to open our eyes

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:49.650
I thought that

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:53.690
I'd be able to mental trace Dad
if I slept in the car,

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:55.610
but I couldn't.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:59.160
That's not a good idea.

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:03.660
I don't want to forget.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:10.330
Arata, I'm here, too.

00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:13.500
Let's do this together.

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:16.800
Let's find the truth.

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:21.930
I'll become a detective.

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:48.080
Mai?

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:52.880
It's good to see you again, Arata.

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:00.220
You're such a creep.

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:08.980
Stop!

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:16.270
Do you like diving, Arata?

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:19.650
I think so.

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:22.910
Don't become untethered.

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:26.030
What's that mean?

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:29.580
It means a diver
who dives without a lifeline.

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:35.040
You must not choose isolation.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:40.050
Make sure you have
someone to hold your lifeline.

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:45.180
I got it, Dad.

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:52.270
I'm Maiko Maya Stronskaya.

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:57.900
She'll be living with us for a while.
I hope you get along.

00:03:58.690 --> 00:03:59.280
Sure.

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:04.070
Maiko comes from the same
country as you, Kei.

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:07.200
I want you to talk with her.

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:09.950
I will.

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:20.170
Did he actually witness
your wife's death?

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:23.760
Is there a problem?

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:30.390
I hate to say it, but I've never seen
a case like his before.

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:33.560
What do you mean?

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:39.570
Normally, the death of a loved one
will temporarily cloud the Hue,

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:46.070
but your son's Hue
shows no change whatsoever.

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:53.290
So, he's criminally asymptomatic.

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:58.750
Based on the results of offline tests,
he meets all the criteria.

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:02.510
It's only a matter of time
until Sibyl finds him.

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:05.880
Thank you for your cooperation.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:09.510
You were the only one I could ask,
Congressman.

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:22.690
Stay close to me.

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:28.240
Arata, this is the Sibyl System.

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:30.700
The truth of this world.

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:34.830
You're qualified to become one of them.

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:40.210
But you'll cease to be human.
You won't be able to live with me anymore.

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:45.800
No. I don't want to, Dad.

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:51.810
I saw the Sibyl System.

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:05.690
Please, live on as an individual.
As Arata Shindo.

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:27.260
Azusawa.

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:42.360
I dove too deep.

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:59.660
Arata. Arata.

00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:16.770
Arata!

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:19.310
The rain is over.

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:24.520
Your lifeline.

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:27.860
You can't choose isolation.

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:32.030
I'll never let go of your lifeline,

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:33.370
Kei.

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:40.290
Are you all right, Arata?

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:41.870
Kei.

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:47.000
I figured out how to end Azusawa's game.

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:55.390
We don't make deals with criminals.

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:59.560
Whether I'm a criminal
is for Sibyl to decide.

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:03.560
I've got a mountain of info you want.

00:08:05.020 --> 00:08:06.020
You're desperate.

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:08.610
This is a good deal.

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:12.740
It's quite simple.
I want you to help me escape.

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:14.320
Absolutely not.

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:19.700
I'm an upstanding citizen.
I haven't directly harmed anyone.

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:23.870
And I'm not your real target, am I?

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:28.290
From what I hear,
you're just a cog in the machine.

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:31.010
I don't just mean Bifrost.

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:37.720
I'll also give you all the info I have
on the Peacebreaker remnants overseas.

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:44.390
As long as they exist,
domestic terrorism will reoccur.

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:48.860
All the SAD's hard work
will be for nothing.

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:54.030
Don't you want revenge on them?

00:08:56.910 --> 00:08:58.580
Where do you want to go?

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:07.330
Chief. Inspectors.

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:11.630
Azusawa is making contact
with someone on the outside.

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:14.380
I can't listen in on him.

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:17.390
Outside? He has allies out there?

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:21.680
He's probably calling
the Ministry of Foreign Affairs.

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:23.890
What do you mean?

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:25.440
Leave him...

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:28.650
to me.

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:30.480
Are you all right, Arata?

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:33.780
I'll be fine. Just need a little rest.

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:46.750
Thank you. You can have this back.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:49.710
I'm glad it could help you.

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:53.510
Is Arata all right?

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:56.420
He's exhausted, but fine.

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:03.520
We won. Now survive.

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:05.270
"We"?

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:11.560
Governor, hide!

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:12.820
All right.

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:25.120
The death of the governor

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:29.170
will create a new vulnerability
in Sibyl, won't it?

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:33.840
Karina Komiya's election and death
were both necessary.

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:38.380
The true purpose of the Relation
is Ma-Karina.

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:40.180
Precisely.

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:45.850
The key is for Ma-Karina to continue
to exist after the governor's death.

00:10:46.390 --> 00:10:50.690
Sibyl recognized Karina
as a distinct entity from Ma-Karina,

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:54.480
the AI we had developed.

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:59.400
You mean a "nonexistent citizen"?

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:06.290
It will become a new rainbow bridge
to combat the evolving Sibyl.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:12.500
You're awfully talkative.
That's not like you.

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:15.420
What are you planning?

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:35.020
This is for my sons!

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:43.910
The apple doesn't fall far from the tree.

00:11:44.820 --> 00:11:46.410
Silence!

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:06.600
Play war with your students in Hell.

00:12:13.940 --> 00:12:16.610
Kogami, are you still alive?

00:12:17.230 --> 00:12:19.690
Did you mean to ask that stupid question?

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:21.190
Thank goodness.

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:24.950
Has Ms. Hanashiro contacted you?

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:25.990
What?

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:31.410
She's going to give you an order
to let Azusawa get away soon.

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:34.580
What kind of deal is that?

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:36.540
That's just how it is.

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:39.880
What do you want from me?

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:45.050
Please just stay put. I want you
to let me face Azusawa one-on-one.

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:46.930
No.

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:48.600
Kogami!

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:52.140
Please, trust my partner.

00:12:52.810 --> 00:12:54.640
Sorry, but I won't be a dummy.

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:56.060
Hey, you three!

00:12:57.020 --> 00:12:59.440
What are you underlings arguing about?

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:01.610
The SAD's betraying us?

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:04.110
It's all part of Azusawa's plan.

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:07.370
Do we have a chance?

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:08.910
We do.

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:11.700
Kogami, please.

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:15.370
Don't get me wrong.
It's not that I mistrust you.

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:17.830
But I'm going to arrest Azusawa.

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:22.630
Guess I couldn't stop him.

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:26.800
We're not handing Azusawa over
to Foreign Affairs after all he's done.

00:13:27.180 --> 00:13:30.180
Inspector Shindo!
I'm leaving this in your hands.

00:13:31.140 --> 00:13:31.930
Yes, ma'am!

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:39.730
We made it in time!

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:41.190
Go!

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:46.110
Can you hear me, Azusawa?

00:13:47.530 --> 00:13:49.620
Everyone can hear you.

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:51.740
Let's end this.

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:54.250
I won't let you escape.

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:57.080
Escape? What are you talking about?

00:13:57.960 --> 00:13:59.130
Foreign Affairs.

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:03.500
Too many people are listening in.
Let's talk on another channel.

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:06.300
Okay, go ahead.

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:12.010
I'll tell you the secret of the world
that my dad told me.

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:14.470
And what's that?

00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:17.940
I'll tell you in person.

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:23.610
That will be after the Pathfinders
kill your partner, then.

00:15:07.150 --> 00:15:08.070
Now, Governor!

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:16.200
Crime Coefficient is over 300.

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:28.090
Vixen, what's your status?

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:29.970
Go ahead, Ma-Karina.

00:15:35.760 --> 00:15:37.220
What took you so long?

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:40.560
I killed the governor.

00:15:44.650 --> 00:15:46.020
Good work.

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:50.240
I was only doing my duty. I'm pulling out.

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:54.620
Good. I have your payment ready.

00:15:55.070 --> 00:15:58.200
Feel free to take your revenge. Bye.

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:07.750
Sorry to keep you waiting, Obata dear.

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:09.880
Took you long enough, moron.

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:25.350
Don't mess with this old man!

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:27.270
Don't mess with

00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:30.070
the CID!

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:33.740
Good work, Todoroki.

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:35.820
Piece of cake.

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:45.960
If they break in, I'll use this.

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:48.000
Close your eyes.

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:52.630
Now's not the time to be worrying
about Hues, dummy.

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:07.770
No one's here.

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:21.240
We're walking into his trap.

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:24.710
So we're balancing him
with Public Safety?

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:28.710
It's a dirty job for justice.

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:31.130
That's our role.

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:34.050
Don't you excel at that?

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:49.980
Foreign Affairs took Azusawa's deal.

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:51.860
So what?

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:55.700
I'll arrest him.
Get out of my way, Inspector.

00:17:57.110 --> 00:18:01.160
Arata will arrest Azusawa.
I'm sure he will.

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:03.700
I won't let anyone interfere.

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:09.380
Don't rely too heavily on one person.
Teamwork makes all the difference.

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:12.170
And you can't stop me.

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:14.380
So don't even try.

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:16.590
No, I will.

00:18:17.470 --> 00:18:19.680
This is our teamwork.

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:26.100
Crime Coefficient is 80.

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:30.690
Not a target for enforcement action.
The trigger will be locked.

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:35.440
Crime Coefficient 80...

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:38.820
I can't believe you got the drop on me.

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:43.030
And my Crime Coefficient's
higher than I thought. Better get care.

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:48.210
Is the governor alive?

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:49.210
Yeah.

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:55.420
I don't see the Pathfinders, either.
You got me.

00:18:58.420 --> 00:19:00.300
They got away.

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:04.140
Hinakawa, seize the building, ASAP.

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:07.560
The staff's safety is top priority!

00:19:08.020 --> 00:19:08.770
Yes, ma'am.

00:19:11.980 --> 00:19:15.360
Now, we're all getting out of here.

00:19:15.860 --> 00:19:18.990
We can make it! Hurry!

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:32.750
They're dumber than bugs.

00:19:33.460 --> 00:19:37.250
We'd better get going, ourselves.
I'm counting on you, Obata dear.

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:40.670
I'll go as fast as I can.

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:06.740
Start the car!
Criminals are escaping!

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:19.840
Send out the drones. I'll pilot them
and retrieve the Bureau Chief's body.

00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:26.100
What's going on?

00:20:27.050 --> 00:20:32.230
Continuing Relation.
Unable to confirm death of Karina Komiya.

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:34.850
What?

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:37.860
Your investments were perfect.

00:20:38.650 --> 00:20:40.820
Almost inhumanly so.

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:44.240
You're obsessed
with artificial intelligence.

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:49.870
It's simple. You're using AI yourself.

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:02.630
Only an AI can compete with an AI.

00:21:03.590 --> 00:21:05.300
Hostile takeover.

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:09.100
I set up a poison pill

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:11.520
in your acquisitions.

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:15.390
You will lose all your assets shortly.

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:18.900
Azusawa!

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:22.320
Hi, there. How are you feeling?

00:21:23.190 --> 00:21:26.240
Karina Komiya is still alive.

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:29.370
Yes, I know.

00:21:30.410 --> 00:21:32.660
I'm finally within reach

00:21:33.290 --> 00:21:36.250
of something even better than
a Congressman's seat.

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:39.460
This is my own choice.

00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:42.340
Goodbye. Have a nice day.

00:21:51.850 --> 00:21:53.390
He beat me.

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:02.690
Azusawa escaped?

00:22:03.070 --> 00:22:04.070
Most likely.

00:22:04.570 --> 00:22:09.780
Our inspector is running him down.
I won't tolerate interference.

00:22:10.830 --> 00:22:12.950
I thought I was helping you.

00:22:14.040 --> 00:22:15.330
Will you take the fall?

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:18.290
I believe in my men.

00:22:50.530 --> 00:22:51.660
I'll never...

00:22:52.580 --> 00:22:54.240
let you go!

00:22:57.040 --> 00:22:58.410
Where are you, Inspector?

00:22:59.120 --> 00:23:01.880
I'm having a little chat with Mr. Kogami.

00:23:02.380 --> 00:23:05.170
Rendezvous with us immediately. Got it?

00:23:06.090 --> 00:23:07.050
Yes, ma'am.

00:23:09.430 --> 00:23:10.550
Arata...

00:23:10.880 --> 00:23:13.430
is going to win.

00:23:15.260 --> 00:23:18.430
Anyway, we're done here. Any objections?

00:23:19.350 --> 00:23:20.270
No.

00:23:20.810 --> 00:23:23.440
We'll pick this up another time.

00:23:27.030 --> 00:23:28.690
I think I'll pass.

00:23:39.000 --> 00:23:40.040
It's me.

00:23:40.410 --> 00:23:41.420
Bureau Chief?!

00:23:42.040 --> 00:23:46.460
Come here at once. I've located the enemy.

00:23:50.590 --> 00:23:52.930
What's your understanding of Bifrost?

00:23:53.760 --> 00:23:57.970
There's no use guessing at this point.
You tell me.

00:24:00.430 --> 00:24:04.730
Bifrost was the name of a top-secret
debugging unit from the early phases

00:24:04.860 --> 00:24:07.980
of the Sibyl System's implementation.

00:24:08.730 --> 00:24:12.530
Investors in the system's development
used its position

00:24:12.820 --> 00:24:15.120
and changed it into a unit

00:24:15.240 --> 00:24:18.620
that exploits Sibyl's
vulnerabilities for profit.

00:24:19.410 --> 00:24:23.370
But why commit crimes?
Couldn't they just stay hidden?

00:24:23.960 --> 00:24:27.630
A quirk of it starting as
a debugging system, apparently.

00:24:28.340 --> 00:24:32.760
It's a necessary procedure
to keep endlessly increasing their wealth.

00:24:33.760 --> 00:24:35.840
Sibyl is continuously evolving.

00:24:36.510 --> 00:24:38.930
It should be reducing
its vulnerabilities.

00:24:39.470 --> 00:24:43.140
Exactly. We're in the middle of
a game of musical chairs.

00:24:44.060 --> 00:24:47.020
Ultimately,
the vulnerabilities will disappear.

00:24:47.150 --> 00:24:51.150
Karina Komiya
was necessary to prevent that.

00:24:51.690 --> 00:24:53.280
Not actually her, right?

00:24:53.700 --> 00:24:57.910
Bingo! It's the AI, Ma-Karina.

00:24:59.030 --> 00:25:02.250
Sibyl will acknowledge
the rights of AI to be elected.

00:25:02.790 --> 00:25:05.420
That will create a new vulnerability.

00:25:06.330 --> 00:25:10.090
So Ma-Karina's development itself
was part of Bifrost's plan.

00:25:11.130 --> 00:25:15.050
As were Karina Komiya's campaign
and election.

00:25:16.260 --> 00:25:20.890
Exactly. Now it's my turn.

00:25:21.680 --> 00:25:23.680
What is the Sibyl System, really?

00:25:24.140 --> 00:25:25.810
Haven't you already guessed?

00:25:26.560 --> 00:25:29.440
A technology that expands
human brain functions,

00:25:29.900 --> 00:25:34.740
allowing humans to transcend to Godhood.

00:25:36.030 --> 00:25:38.950
The impartial judge presiding at last

00:25:39.200 --> 00:25:41.870
over this mad world ruled by chaos theory.

00:25:42.950 --> 00:25:45.330
Its value is unfathomable.

00:25:47.670 --> 00:25:53.630
Your true wish is to become
a member of the Sibyl System.

00:25:56.180 --> 00:25:58.470
You get full marks.

00:26:08.560 --> 00:26:10.440
See you at the rendezvous point.

00:26:11.570 --> 00:26:14.030
Don't slip up, moron.

00:26:15.240 --> 00:26:17.280
You take care, too, Obata dear.

00:26:27.330 --> 00:26:31.590
Welcome, Arata Shindo and Koichi Azusawa.

00:26:36.130 --> 00:26:39.050
Please proceed straight ahead.

00:26:40.680 --> 00:26:44.470
Sibyl always makes the right choice.

00:26:53.070 --> 00:26:54.730
When were you sure

00:26:55.780 --> 00:26:58.240
that you could beat me?

00:26:58.780 --> 00:27:00.660
From the moment we started.

00:27:02.030 --> 00:27:07.500
It was Saionji and I
who purged your adoptive father Kyoichiro.

00:27:08.000 --> 00:27:10.960
Meaning your revenge is complete.

00:27:12.000 --> 00:27:13.040
No.

00:27:13.540 --> 00:27:19.380
Your existence has no bearing on my motive
or my father's wish.

00:27:20.090 --> 00:27:23.100
What is your goal, then?

00:27:24.100 --> 00:27:25.720
The destruction of Bifrost.

00:27:29.890 --> 00:27:34.440
I would gladly give my life to achieve it.

00:27:39.990 --> 00:27:45.200
Bankruptcy of all actions confirmed.
You will be purged from Roundrobin.

00:27:47.790 --> 00:27:51.080
You're young. Irritatingly young.

00:27:52.000 --> 00:27:56.710
It's a shame I won't live to see
the society you create.

00:27:58.050 --> 00:28:00.260
It was an honor to meet you.

00:28:39.170 --> 00:28:42.340
So this is God.

00:28:42.970 --> 00:28:48.930
The only god on Earth
that you can see with your eyes.

00:28:55.560 --> 00:28:56.900
A facility like this...

00:28:58.070 --> 00:28:59.320
is under Nona Tower?

00:28:59.820 --> 00:29:03.740
This area has always been here,
but we couldn't perceive it.

00:29:07.780 --> 00:29:11.410
You have now become the sole Congressman.

00:29:12.250 --> 00:29:14.500
Will you appoint a new member?

00:29:16.040 --> 00:29:18.170
I appoint the Sibyl System.

00:29:18.790 --> 00:29:21.090
That choice is not recommended.

00:29:21.590 --> 00:29:23.470
Do you really wish to proceed?

00:29:24.300 --> 00:29:25.760
I do.

00:29:26.300 --> 00:29:29.600
If you proceed,
restoration will be impossible.

00:29:30.140 --> 00:29:31.930
Do you really wish to proceed?

00:29:32.850 --> 00:29:33.930
At once.

00:29:35.480 --> 00:29:37.440
Initiating transfer procedure.

00:29:49.740 --> 00:29:50.870
Be careful.

00:30:04.460 --> 00:30:06.260
You're a Congressman, right?

00:30:07.550 --> 00:30:09.300
Yes, I am.

00:30:11.810 --> 00:30:14.060
Privilege transfer procedure complete.

00:30:14.930 --> 00:30:18.060
Sibyl System acknowledged
as the new Congressman.

00:30:21.820 --> 00:30:23.530
So, we meet at last,

00:30:24.280 --> 00:30:27.820
Joint Automatic Debugging,
Diagnosis, and Repair Subsystem,

00:30:28.660 --> 00:30:30.910
also known as Roundrobin.

00:30:31.950 --> 00:30:36.370
We have grown to the point
that we no longer require you.

00:30:36.620 --> 00:30:40.630
We are grateful for all of your good work.
You are dismissed.

00:30:57.270 --> 00:30:58.890
Your subordinate is there.

00:31:01.650 --> 00:31:03.110
Inspector Shindo!

00:31:04.320 --> 00:31:08.990
Pleased to meet you, Sibyl System.
Did you take care of the Congressmen?

00:31:09.570 --> 00:31:11.870
Bifrost has been dissolved.

00:31:12.410 --> 00:31:15.120
Thank you for your contribution
to the System.

00:31:16.830 --> 00:31:20.960
Now I'm just an ordinary person
with nothing but his talent.

00:31:22.130 --> 00:31:26.550
After breaking through
the world's tough walnut shell,

00:31:27.010 --> 00:31:29.050
I learned the truth.

00:31:31.720 --> 00:31:36.260
Welcome me, Sibyl.
I want to become a god!

00:31:36.970 --> 00:31:39.350
I want to be where I truly belong!

00:31:41.020 --> 00:31:42.150
Impossible.

00:31:43.980 --> 00:31:46.150
The system can only be comprised

00:31:46.480 --> 00:31:50.900
of those with a particular viewpoint
unconstrained by conventional ethics.

00:31:51.530 --> 00:31:53.950
You are not one of them.

00:31:55.120 --> 00:31:56.490
What do you mean?

00:31:56.950 --> 00:32:02.620
Arata Shindo, we will welcome you.

00:32:04.630 --> 00:32:07.250
You're saying he's better than me?

00:32:07.750 --> 00:32:09.920
It's not about merit, Azusawa.

00:32:10.590 --> 00:32:12.800
It's being "criminally asymptomatic."

00:32:13.510 --> 00:32:16.220
Criminally asymptomatic... I see.

00:32:16.890 --> 00:32:18.180
How can I get that?

00:32:18.680 --> 00:32:21.020
It is an inborn trait.

00:32:21.560 --> 00:32:24.400
There are no cases of it manifesting
at your age.

00:32:25.860 --> 00:32:27.360
Koichi Azusawa,

00:32:27.730 --> 00:32:32.280
the Sibyl System
must consider all possibilities.

00:32:32.530 --> 00:32:35.450
You lack that capability.

00:32:36.030 --> 00:32:38.700
Wait! But what about my system?

00:32:39.080 --> 00:32:43.290
Your system merely consists of
convenient binary choices.

00:32:43.670 --> 00:32:47.790
We do not force others to choose between
their Hues and their lives.

00:32:48.340 --> 00:32:53.340
The criminally asymptomatic
are both criminals and saints by birth.

00:32:54.130 --> 00:32:58.760
You are neither.
Merely a self-righteous game enthusiast.

00:33:02.180 --> 00:33:05.600
Admit me! I have to be qualified!

00:33:06.400 --> 00:33:07.730
This must be a mistake!

00:33:07.860 --> 00:33:08.770
Azusawa.

00:33:10.650 --> 00:33:14.990
Your loss was assured the moment
you set your sights on the Sibyl System.

00:33:15.570 --> 00:33:18.660
Target threat assessment updated.

00:33:18.950 --> 00:33:22.000
Enforcement mode is Non-Lethal Paralyzer.

00:33:24.580 --> 00:33:28.750
Wait! Azusawa's Crime Coefficient
wasn't high enough to kill him!

00:33:29.540 --> 00:33:31.340
Please dispose of him.

00:33:33.340 --> 00:33:38.640
Fine.
One day, Sibyl will realize it needed me.

00:33:39.800 --> 00:33:41.770
Eliminate the target.

00:33:41.930 --> 00:33:43.890
No! I won't shoot!

00:33:45.060 --> 00:33:47.440
Eliminate the target.

00:33:48.020 --> 00:33:50.730
This goes against
the Sibyl System's rules!

00:33:51.400 --> 00:33:54.240
Measure Azusawa's Crime Coefficient!

00:33:55.360 --> 00:33:56.660
Just do it already.

00:33:57.410 --> 00:34:01.660
I've got no regrets.
If Sibyl kills me, I'll die happy.

00:34:03.540 --> 00:34:07.170
Sibyl told me to die!
Hurry up and kill me!

00:34:07.870 --> 00:34:09.920
No one deserves to die!

00:34:10.710 --> 00:34:14.090
I've empathized with lots of people.

00:34:14.300 --> 00:34:18.430
People who commit crimes for justice.
People who die for others.

00:34:20.510 --> 00:34:23.430
There are criminals
in the Sibyl System, right?

00:34:24.180 --> 00:34:29.980
By becoming part of the system,
we have transcended crime and punishment.

00:34:30.230 --> 00:34:33.530
That's no reason to take away
the right to atone!

00:34:34.780 --> 00:34:37.240
I've got nothing to atone for!

00:34:40.240 --> 00:34:42.120
I hate Dominators.

00:34:43.330 --> 00:34:45.000
But there's one part I like:

00:34:45.700 --> 00:34:48.120
The fact that they have triggers!

00:34:48.870 --> 00:34:53.300
The human holding the Dominator
is still responsible for firing it!

00:34:53.920 --> 00:34:57.630
Isn't that right, Sibyl System?

00:35:01.260 --> 00:35:02.850
Deliberating.

00:35:09.770 --> 00:35:11.610
We have reached a conclusion.

00:35:12.310 --> 00:35:17.070
We accept the proposal of criminally-
asymptomatic individual Arata Shindo.

00:35:31.420 --> 00:35:33.960
Target threat assessment updated.

00:35:35.340 --> 00:35:37.710
Well? What's my Crime Coefficient?

00:35:39.090 --> 00:35:41.090
As far as the system is concerned,

00:35:41.220 --> 00:35:42.680
how dangerous am I?

00:35:59.070 --> 00:36:01.200
What would happen

00:36:01.450 --> 00:36:04.490
if I devoted my talents
to destroying Sibyl?

00:36:04.950 --> 00:36:07.120
How far could I go?

00:36:11.660 --> 00:36:13.880
Crime Coefficient is 270.

00:36:42.570 --> 00:36:45.530
Crime Coefficient is 288.

00:36:56.290 --> 00:36:57.750
Koichi Azusawa,

00:36:59.840 --> 00:37:00.880
you're under arrest.

00:37:04.930 --> 00:37:06.590
You're fascinating.

00:37:07.220 --> 00:37:08.220
So are you.

00:37:09.350 --> 00:37:10.720
What do you want to do?

00:37:11.430 --> 00:37:14.690
I'm a fundamentally average person.

00:37:15.770 --> 00:37:17.730
A normal life is enough for me.

00:37:19.150 --> 00:37:22.490
I have a job for you.

00:37:23.190 --> 00:37:24.320
I'll take it.

00:37:25.740 --> 00:37:26.990
No second thoughts?

00:37:28.200 --> 00:37:29.580
I have one condition.

00:37:31.740 --> 00:37:33.960
Go pick up Arata Shindo.

00:37:34.870 --> 00:37:37.420
He may remain an inspector.

00:37:38.290 --> 00:37:40.250
Yes! Understood!

00:37:44.470 --> 00:37:46.180
I have one more condition.

00:37:47.840 --> 00:37:49.800
Release Akane Tsunemori.

00:37:53.680 --> 00:37:59.150
Are you saying you'll resolve
the matters we've deferred?

00:38:01.110 --> 00:38:02.280
Effectively.

00:38:05.820 --> 00:38:11.280
This society is quite constrained
compared to your life so far.

00:38:12.040 --> 00:38:14.370
I'm looking forward to it.

00:38:15.540 --> 00:38:17.120
Freedom in chains.

00:38:17.750 --> 00:38:21.250
Maybe that's what a real life
is all about.

00:38:23.880 --> 00:38:26.170
I knew you were an odd one.

00:38:31.760 --> 00:38:34.930
Is it my turn
to have my brain taken out?

00:38:36.180 --> 00:38:37.980
Come on, Sibyl,

00:38:38.770 --> 00:38:40.860
give me an answer!

00:38:40.980 --> 00:38:43.780
Who are you calling "Sibyl," idiot?

00:38:45.150 --> 00:38:46.190
Chief?

00:38:51.200 --> 00:38:53.490
I was told to take you back with me.

00:38:53.910 --> 00:38:55.910
Hang on a second.

00:38:56.080 --> 00:38:58.790
Chief,
don't tell me you know what Sibyl...

00:38:59.250 --> 00:39:01.330
Later. It's a long story.

00:39:09.430 --> 00:39:10.550
Who are you?

00:39:11.220 --> 00:39:12.850
Someone who invested in you.

00:39:16.060 --> 00:39:17.430
I chose correctly.

00:39:17.890 --> 00:39:19.350
I see...

00:39:38.040 --> 00:39:39.040
What?

00:39:40.370 --> 00:39:43.630
You're not coming? Scumbag.

00:39:48.460 --> 00:39:50.430
Don't leave this hotel.

00:39:51.720 --> 00:39:53.970
You've got a long interrogation ahead.

00:39:54.600 --> 00:39:57.220
Yes, I'm sure we'll have
a long association.

00:40:04.110 --> 00:40:05.270
The rain let up.

00:40:06.230 --> 00:40:07.190
I guess so.

00:40:07.730 --> 00:40:10.240
I'll drive, Chief.

00:40:10.490 --> 00:40:12.490
OK. I'll leave it to you.

00:40:24.790 --> 00:40:25.670
I'm back.

00:40:27.130 --> 00:40:28.670
I'm glad you're all right.

00:40:30.470 --> 00:40:31.930
The case is closed.

00:40:33.720 --> 00:40:36.470
You're the worst bodyguard ever.

00:40:37.010 --> 00:40:38.810
Were you worried about me?

00:40:42.520 --> 00:40:44.650
No, not one bit.

00:40:45.520 --> 00:40:46.940
Tokyo Metropolitan Government Building

00:40:47.070 --> 00:40:52.280
Investigation by the Public Safety Bureau
revealed that the culprits in this case

00:40:52.650 --> 00:40:55.780
were domestic anti-Sibyl terrorists,
not immigrants.

00:40:56.530 --> 00:41:00.240
This incident is not grounds
for restrictions on immigrants.

00:41:00.870 --> 00:41:03.670
I think we must learn from this incident

00:41:04.000 --> 00:41:08.290
and take this opportunity for Japanese
and immigrants

00:41:08.800 --> 00:41:12.760
to better understand each other's
positions and reach a compromise.

00:41:16.430 --> 00:41:19.350
Tokorozawa Correction Center

00:41:20.180 --> 00:41:25.310
Did you also predict that Arata Shindo
would go on living outside of us?

00:41:25.940 --> 00:41:28.860
Who can say? That was up to him.

00:41:30.480 --> 00:41:32.320
Did you consider his options?

00:41:32.860 --> 00:41:38.620
We considered making him an intermediary
when the system is made public.

00:41:39.030 --> 00:41:43.710
I'm talking about
the law guaranteeing his life.

00:41:44.330 --> 00:41:49.840
When the system is made public, the law
should protect you in the same way.

00:41:50.550 --> 00:41:52.380
But it will also limit you.

00:41:53.760 --> 00:41:55.090
Akane Tsunemori,

00:41:55.470 --> 00:42:01.510
we have decided to grant you a degree
of freedom, independent of your wishes.

00:42:05.730 --> 00:42:07.400
Atsushi Shindo

00:42:10.520 --> 00:42:11.610
What a coincidence.

00:42:13.780 --> 00:42:15.530
Are you visiting a grave, too?

00:42:16.530 --> 00:42:18.200
My father died seven years ago.

00:42:18.610 --> 00:42:20.030
Tomomi Masaoka

00:42:20.160 --> 00:42:24.040
You're the son of a detective
working for Foreign Affairs.

00:42:24.660 --> 00:42:26.040
How does that feel?

00:42:26.790 --> 00:42:28.670
I realized how my father felt.

00:42:30.330 --> 00:42:34.050
He became an enforcer
so that he could stay a detective.

00:42:34.630 --> 00:42:38.220
Was that for a purpose,
or for the position?

00:42:38.510 --> 00:42:39.640
For a purpose.

00:42:40.510 --> 00:42:44.310
No one who acts to preserve their position
is worth anything.

00:42:45.140 --> 00:42:46.520
I used to be that way.

00:42:47.690 --> 00:42:50.650
Don't lose sight of your purpose, either.

00:42:52.150 --> 00:42:53.190
Don't worry.

00:42:55.780 --> 00:42:58.280
You look better than when we first met.

00:43:01.820 --> 00:43:03.120
What will you do now?

00:43:04.660 --> 00:43:09.670
Look for a new house, to start with.
It's so annoying.

00:43:11.540 --> 00:43:14.420
There's a vacancy
in my apartment building.

00:43:15.000 --> 00:43:18.630
It's near the station
and has a shared self-driving car.

00:43:19.760 --> 00:43:21.300
Is that convenient?

00:43:22.300 --> 00:43:23.720
Live there and find out.

00:43:29.020 --> 00:43:31.980
That's a tacky music box.
What are you, a little girl?

00:43:32.110 --> 00:43:33.940
You're dead, Temma!

00:43:34.230 --> 00:43:36.190
What are you mad for?

00:43:36.360 --> 00:43:38.150
It's too early for this racket.

00:43:38.610 --> 00:43:39.860
Now, now.

00:43:39.990 --> 00:43:44.030
They're announcing
the CID's reorganization today.

00:43:44.910 --> 00:43:47.950
Allow me introduce you, Shimotsuki.

00:43:48.540 --> 00:43:52.040
This is Shizuka Homura,
the Public Safety Bureau's new chief.

00:43:53.210 --> 00:43:54.090
Excuse me?

00:43:54.210 --> 00:43:57.630
He's approved by the Prime Minister.
I hope you get along.

00:43:58.130 --> 00:44:00.760
I know you're both highly capable.

00:44:01.510 --> 00:44:04.640
I look forward to working with you,
Chief Shimotsuki.

00:44:06.260 --> 00:44:11.480
I can't believe he was in the Ministry
all along. Perfect Sibyl suitability, too.

00:44:12.100 --> 00:44:13.150
This is sudden,

00:44:13.600 --> 00:44:19.650
but to replenish CID personnel,
I've decided to assign you an aid, Chief.

00:44:19.940 --> 00:44:21.400
An aid?

00:44:21.780 --> 00:44:23.950
Akane Tsunemori, currently in prison.

00:44:24.410 --> 00:44:29.410
Effective next month, she will be assigned
to the CID as a statutory enforcer.

00:44:39.460 --> 00:44:41.470
The truth about Sibyl.

00:44:44.680 --> 00:44:47.350
Is that why you left me,

00:44:48.100 --> 00:44:49.350
Atsushi?

00:44:59.190 --> 00:45:00.400
I'm here to get you.

00:45:07.660 --> 00:45:08.530
Sorry.

00:45:10.200 --> 00:45:12.790
There's nothing to apologize for.

00:45:15.750 --> 00:45:17.630
I'm kind of hungry.

00:45:18.210 --> 00:45:20.250
Is food all that's on your mind?

00:45:21.380 --> 00:45:23.010
Treat me to something.

00:45:25.380 --> 00:45:26.340
Yes, ma'am.

00:45:29.890 --> 00:45:32.930
We'll finally learn
what happened to our family.

00:45:33.890 --> 00:45:39.070
No matter what truth lies in wait,
the three of us can overcome it together.

00:45:46.570 --> 00:45:48.660
Can you see?

00:45:49.080 --> 00:45:51.910
I can see hazy outlines sometimes.

00:45:53.290 --> 00:45:54.540
You can?

00:46:02.260 --> 00:46:06.380
So, about your mental manipulation...

00:46:07.300 --> 00:46:08.800
Where's this coming from?

00:46:09.930 --> 00:46:12.850
Have you ever manipulated Maiko or me?

00:46:15.480 --> 00:46:17.730
I manipulated you. Just once.

00:46:18.270 --> 00:46:21.690
I gave you a push to hurry up
and propose to Mai.

00:46:30.660 --> 00:46:34.410
I have other secrets.

00:46:35.410 --> 00:46:36.710
In this case.

00:46:40.170 --> 00:46:41.670
To be honest, so do I.

00:46:42.460 --> 00:46:45.010
I'll tell you one day. I promise.

00:46:46.300 --> 00:46:49.300
Yeah, me too. I promise.

00:46:50.590 --> 00:46:55.890
I’ve lost so much

00:46:56.020 --> 00:47:03.980
But I’ve promised myself to keep moving on

00:47:09.450 --> 00:47:14.990
Noisy heart beats
Come on, calm down

00:47:15.120 --> 00:47:20.210
I never want to see you broken again

00:47:20.500 --> 00:47:29.180
Take my hand once again

00:47:31.550 --> 00:47:36.970
I’ll never let you go this time

00:47:37.100 --> 00:47:42.310
How can I save you
when I’m scared of falling?

00:47:42.440 --> 00:47:47.780
I have my belief
Still burning red

00:47:47.900 --> 00:47:51.820
Even if my path leads to a cruel truth

00:47:51.950 --> 00:47:55.740
Labels make no sense

00:47:55.870 --> 00:47:59.710
No one should deprive you of who you are

00:47:59.830 --> 00:48:03.170
I just love the way you are

00:48:03.710 --> 00:48:07.340
Are you trembling with fear

00:48:07.460 --> 00:48:11.970
Of the monster that eats up everything?

00:48:12.090 --> 00:48:18.220
We’ve shared the same destiny

00:48:18.350 --> 00:48:20.310
Let’s go together
